- ACTION: Tighten the layout: reduce the empty band below the figure and enlarge the pictorial/FBD group so labels read comfortably at inline size.
- ACTION: Fix the UI panel label wrapping ('m₂ = 4.0 kg (m₁ fixed at 2.0 kg)' currently wraps across three lines) so the slider caption reads as one line.

